      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud Vertex AI as the provider for this Python script, making it readily identifiable within the code. I plan to leverage the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library for integration.\n\n\n**Establishing the Blueprint**\n\nI'm now concretizing the setup, opting for a `invoke_platform_model.py` script. The intent is clear: to harness Google Cloud Vertex AI's potential. My next steps involve crafting Python code that interfaces with a Vertex AI model, using `google.cloud.aiplatform` for the heavy lifting. I'll probably go with `TextGenerationModel` for its simplicity, ensuring I incorporate provider-specific identifiers.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866195663,
          "start": 1789866193257
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc56b169001yDDSaVon1mrjQ2",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc56ac55001Ueg8yPk2xtILf0",
      "session_id": "ses_f43a95433ffePEMb6SRt3nLAV2",
      "time_created": 1789866193257,
      "time_updated": 1789866195664
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "bgbqynx002dwCZRQ",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import aiplatform\n\ndef invoke_vertex_ai_model(project_id: str, location: str, model_name: str, prompt: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    Invokes a Google Cloud Vertex AI model for text generation.\n\n    Args:\n        project_id: Your Google Cloud project ID.\n        location: The region where your model is deployed (e.g., \"us-central1\").\n        model_name: The name of the model to invoke (e.g., \"text-bison@001\").\n        prompt: The text prompt to send to the model.\n\n    Returns:\n        The model's generated response.\n    \"\"\"\n    aiplatform.init(project=project_id, location=location)\n    model = aiplatform.TextGenerationModel.from_pretrained(model_name)\n    response = model.predict(prompt=prompt)\n    return response.text\n\nif __name__ == \"__main_\":\n    # Replace with your actual project ID, location, and model name\n    PROJECT_ID = \"your-gcp-project-id\"\n    LOCATION = \"us-central1\"\n    MODEL_NAME = \"text-bison@001\"  # Or another appropriate model\n\n    test_prompt = \"What is the capital of France?\"\n    \n    try:\n        generated_text = invoke_vertex_ai_model(PROJECT_ID, LOCATION, MODEL_NAME, test_prompt)\n        print(f\"Generated Text: {generated_text}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"An error occurred: {e}\")\n",
            "filePath": "invoke_platform_model.py"
          },
